    "body": "`vim._watch.watch()` asserts when `uv.fs_stat()` returns an error other than `ENOENT` while classifying a rename event. On Windows, a transient `EPERM` for Git-managed files can repeatedly raise errors from\r\n  the luv callback.\r\n\r\n  ## Solution\r\n\r\n  Skip rename events whose type cannot be determined while keeping the watcher active for later events. Add a deterministic regression test for `EPERM`.\r\n\r\n  Fixes #32386",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-03T09:55:44Z",
