            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "IIRC, I didn't happen to run into any valid cases where an error would be expected here, so the `assert` was only meant to make those unexpected errors more visible. An assertion might not have the best semantics in that case, maybe plainly logging is more appropriate.\n\nI agree though that we should try to more narrowly scope the errors that get ignored here.",
