    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> On Windows, a transient `EPERM` for Git-managed files can repeatedly raise errors from\r\n> the luv callback.\r\n\r\nso why does this PR ignore ALL errors instead of only EPERM (which could perhaps also be logged-once)",
