        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I have low confidence in the work here, so I'm just going to close it. Review https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#ai-assisted-work and if you want to try another PR in the future, be sure to apply that.\r\n\r\nObviously to \"fix\" an error it can be ignored, that isn't helpful. What matters is that you, the human, use your AI to research possibilities, find the best solution, and explain concisely why this is a good solution. And then cover it with a test. And do so in a way that minimizes code cost.\r\n\r\nAn obvious question is why doesn't this error class apply to the other watcher backends: watchdirs, inotify. Maybe it doesn't apply then, but you should explain that.",
